{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Roguelike Deckbuilder Forged in Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a cursed world where every choice has a price. <i>Unsealed Pact</i> blends the addictive strategy of deckbuilding with the high-stakes tension of roguelikes. Bargain with forbidden powers, endure crippling curses, and carve your path through relentless foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Deck, Seal Your Fate</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cards, relics, and potions to forge unique strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your deck every run \u2014 no two journeys play the same.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle Relentless Enemies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat where tactical choices decide survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice changes the flow of battle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Shop of Temptations</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend hard-earned coins on potions, relics, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wisely \u2014 every purchase can strengthen or doom your run.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immerse in Dark Fantasy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunting art and atmospheric soundscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that whispers of ancient bargains and unsealed horrors.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural encounters ensure fresh challenges every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels and branching choices keep the pact alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you embrace power \u2014 or fall to corruption?</strong><br>The pact awaits.<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Add <i>Unsealed Pact</i> to your Wishlist to follow updates and support development!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679070?t=1762163913","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/8bb67dbc78445a9c835a6daa4576e0235c581cb1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762163913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/3766da0bc5f56261efc105eca0914a5b29c9c77f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762163913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679070/3766da0bc5f56261efc105eca0914a5b29c9c77f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762163913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3916590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Roguelike Deckbuilder Forged in Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a cursed world where every choice has a price. <i>Unsealed Pact</i> blends the addictive strategy of deckbuilding with the high-stakes tension of roguelikes. Bargain with forbidden powers, endure crippling curses, and carve your path through relentless foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Deck, Seal Your Fate</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cards, relics, and potions to forge unique strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your deck every run \u2014 no two journeys play the same.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle Relentless Enemies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based com